<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Samsonite started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Samsonite started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analysts Polly Becker and Sandra Kim have started coverage of Samsonite Corp with a rating of outperform, a source at the brokerage said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares closed at 50-1/4 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
